ormation and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob10re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Making Requests", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use a variety of phrases to make requests.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Do you think you could introduce me to Aunt Nelly sometime?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Is there any chance you could wear that blue shirt?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You can use modals to make requests.</p> For example:</br> Could you ... ?</br> Can you ... ?</br> Would you mind if ... ?</p> You can also use other phrases with these modals to make requests.</p> For example:</p> Do you think you could ... ?</br> Is there any chance you can ... ?", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "housework", "type": "name"}, {"content": "work done at home like laundry, cleaning, etc.", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I usually help with the housework.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about daily routines.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "polo shirt", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a collared T-shirt", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Could you wear that blue polo shirt?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to spend ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to use", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I spend a lot of time thinking about you.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to help out", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to help someone do something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I like to help out with the housework.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "rest ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the remaining amount", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: What about the rest of the day?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "nervous", "type": "name"}, {"content": "anxious; worried", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I sometimes get nervous when I meet my girlfriend's family.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob10aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Ask your partner about what they do to help out around the house.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make a list of the things they do. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make a list of the things you do. How do the lists compare?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a paragraph comparing you and your partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read the paragraph to another person.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I ask my partner questions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I make a list and write a paragraph.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use words that talk about frequency.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read the paragraph to another person.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le12ob10re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn5le12ob10re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "time": "0", "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn5le12ob10re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: What do you do every day, Vanessa? I know you work a lot, but what about the rest of the day?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, I spend a lot of my time thinking about you ... </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: That's good.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I usually help my Aunt Nelly with the grocery shopping and housework. I like to help out as much as I can."}, {"image": "engenn5le12ob10re2img05.jpg", "id": 2, "time": "18100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Do you think you could introduce me to Aunt Nelly sometime? I would love to meet her.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sure. We usually have family dinner on Thursday nights. Do you want to come this week?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Great! I sometimes get nervous when I meet my girlfriend's family. It depends on how much I like her."}, {"image": "engenn5le12ob10re2img01.jpg", "id": 3, "time": "34600", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: How nervous are you to meet my family?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Very!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Is there any chance you could wear that blue polo shirt of yours? You look so handsome in it!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: No problem ... I'll wash it tonight!"}], "coverimg": "engenn5le12ob10re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about how frequently I do something.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about daily routines.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can make and respond to requests.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": 